WEBVTT

00:00:00.009 --> 00:01:45.830
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:02:10.039 --> 00:02:10.840
Let me.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.439
The surgery is over.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.319
The patient is out of danger for now.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:19.719
Just keep monitoring him.

00:02:19.919 --> 00:02:21.400
If anything happens, call the doctor right away.

00:02:21.759 --> 00:02:22.560
Okay.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:29.879
It's all in code.

00:02:30.039 --> 00:02:31.719
Trace where the phone lines run.

00:02:31.879 --> 00:02:32.400
Got it.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:38.759
Not too hot, Uncle?

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:39.280
It's fine.

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:41.039
Pour me some more.

00:02:43.719 --> 00:02:44.560
Sure, sure.

00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:48.199
Do you have a fever?

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:49.919
No.

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:55.680
I heard...

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.280
Mayor Xie visited your institute for an inspection.

00:02:58.599 --> 00:03:00.159
Did you see him?

00:03:01.719 --> 00:03:02.360
Well...

00:03:02.639 --> 00:03:03.919
Did you bring up my issue?

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.400
There were too many people.

00:03:07.439 --> 00:03:08.439
I didn't bring it up.

00:03:08.439 --> 00:03:10.080
I mentioned it briefly to his secretary.

00:03:11.039 --> 00:03:14.159
Didn't you get a phone number or anything?

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.520
A senior leader like him,

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.520
how could he just give you his number?

00:03:18.639 --> 00:03:19.879
Someone in his position,

00:03:19.879 --> 00:03:21.479
he can't just hand out his number.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.599
You could've at least gotten his secretary's.

00:03:25.039 --> 00:03:25.879
Look, Uncle.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.800
If you were in that situation

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:28.840
and brought it up to him,

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.840
he definitely would've agreed.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:36.000
Last time you went abroad for that soccer exchange,

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.520
which countries did you visit?

00:03:39.199 --> 00:03:40.960
Europe, South Korea, and Japan.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.479
Any plans for an overseas inspection soon?

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.960
I'm applying. Why?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:49.400
No reason.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.080
You've been to so many countries.

00:04:00.599 --> 00:04:02.680
Which one do you think is the safest?

00:04:04.199 --> 00:04:05.080
What do you mean?

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.280
Nothing, I was just asking.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:41.720
Keep this confidential.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:27.279
Come in.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:46.920
Letter of guarantee.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.040
Read it carefully.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.560
Over the past year,

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.920
has your boyfriend met with your aunt

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.480
or your uncle?

00:07:07.519 --> 00:07:08.319
Yes.

00:07:12.399 --> 00:07:14.040
Did they talk to each other?

00:07:15.759 --> 00:07:16.879
No.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:20.759
Did they exchange contact info?

00:07:21.279 --> 00:07:24.120
Like cell phones, pagers,

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:25.279
or extension numbers?

00:07:25.879 --> 00:07:26.480
No.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:27.600
Definitely not.

00:07:28.319 --> 00:07:29.879
You've been staying at school lately.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.480
Why do you rarely go home?

00:07:36.879 --> 00:07:38.720
I failed my exams.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.120
I'm under a lot of pressure.

00:07:40.439 --> 00:07:41.639
How do you know everything?

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.240
Am I questioning you,

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.000
or are you questioning me?

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:48.560
Did something happen to someone?

00:07:48.839 --> 00:07:50.639
Is it Xiao Lu or my aunt?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.879
Every word spoken tonight,

00:07:55.639 --> 00:07:56.879
you must take it to the grave.

00:07:57.279 --> 00:07:58.519
If any of it leaks,

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.720
it will be your responsibility.

00:08:00.959 --> 00:08:01.639
Understood?

00:08:02.079 --> 00:08:02.800
Understood.

00:08:03.639 --> 00:08:04.759
What happened to them?

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.639
The garrison's drill plans were leaked.

00:08:06.839 --> 00:08:07.920
It involves Taiwan Strait security.

00:08:08.279 --> 00:08:09.079
The military opened a case.

00:08:09.279 --> 00:08:10.600
Everyone must be investigated.

00:08:13.319 --> 00:08:15.360
As a citizen of the PRC

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:16.879
and a student,

00:08:17.439 --> 00:08:19.160
cooperating and proactively reporting info

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.560
is serving the country.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:22.399
Understood?

00:08:22.399 --> 00:08:23.000
Understood.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:23.600
Understood?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.319
Understood.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:26.519
Sign here.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:33.360
Leave your thumbprint.

00:08:41.039 --> 00:08:44.000
You both work for Taiwan, China bosses.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:45.720
Stay vigilant.

00:08:46.399 --> 00:08:47.679
Also, your aunt's movements,

00:08:47.679 --> 00:08:49.440
both her actions and her thoughts,

00:08:49.799 --> 00:08:50.519
keep an eye on them.

00:08:50.919 --> 00:08:51.440
Okay.

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:53.519
Has your boss from Taiwan, China

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.000
ever mentioned

00:08:55.759 --> 00:08:56.840
wanting to meet your aunt?

00:08:57.759 --> 00:08:58.720
Never.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.039
Really?

00:09:27.559 --> 00:09:28.440
Lies

00:09:30.039 --> 00:09:31.639
have a distinct smell.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.120
I can smell it.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.519
Understand?

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.000
What time is it? Old Wei isn't here yet.

00:10:22.919 --> 00:10:24.240
Morning, Brother Qi. Morning, Brother Wu.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.279
Morning.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.240
94, 95, 96, 97...

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.080
100.

00:10:49.639 --> 00:10:51.759
Have some tea. Wake up.

00:10:53.919 --> 00:10:55.080
Young people these days...

00:10:55.399 --> 00:10:58.120
You shouldn't overwork yourself.

00:10:58.279 --> 00:11:00.120
Who makes breakfast every morning?

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.120
Is it you or your girlfriend?

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.360
Girlfriend? I don't have one.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.480
What are you so nervous about?

00:11:07.879 --> 00:11:08.399
Am I nervous?

00:11:08.399 --> 00:11:09.240
Aren't you?

00:11:11.559 --> 00:11:12.360
Come on,

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.879
with the two of you staring at me like this,

00:11:13.879 --> 00:11:14.960
who wouldn't be?

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.159
A guilty conscience.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.879
Scared before the ghost even shows up.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:21.159
Li Fengge.

00:11:21.879 --> 00:11:24.000
Circulate this document, then collect it.

00:11:31.879 --> 00:11:33.360
Let's get straight to the point.

00:11:33.759 --> 00:11:35.840
Let's discuss the leads on Institute 761.

00:11:37.519 --> 00:11:38.399
Come on, Old Wei.

00:11:39.279 --> 00:11:40.360
Have a seat. Let's talk sitting down.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.120
About the Hong Kong, China conference,

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.279
I think Cao Liaoping will definitely attend.

00:11:46.639 --> 00:11:48.399
The target Chunxiao and Jinlan are tailing,

00:11:48.399 --> 00:11:49.639
how he will coordinate with Cao

00:11:49.639 --> 00:11:50.679
requires careful deliberation.

00:11:51.279 --> 00:11:53.240
Everyone along the chain will surely act.

00:11:53.679 --> 00:11:56.080
Lately, the uncle and nephew are very close.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.120
In theory,

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.320
the nephew could also become a Courier.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.639
Maybe he wasn't before,

00:12:00.639 --> 00:12:02.120
but we can't rule him out now.

00:12:02.279 --> 00:12:03.240
Let's consider a scenario:

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.720
What if Cao Xiao'ou goes along with him?

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.960
And once they're out, besides making contact,

00:12:08.279 --> 00:12:09.720
what if they try to flee?

00:12:09.879 --> 00:12:11.240
Will one run, or both?

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:12.919
What if they don't return?

00:12:12.919 --> 00:12:14.679
The higher-ups need all contingency plans

00:12:14.679 --> 00:12:15.440
before granting approval.

00:12:15.879 --> 00:12:17.799
Don't give leaders open-ended questions.

00:12:17.919 --> 00:12:19.159
Give them multiple-choice options.

00:12:19.159 --> 00:12:20.360
Provide several alternatives.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.279
Among the suspects,

00:12:22.279 --> 00:12:24.679
the priority is to detain one of them.

00:12:24.679 --> 00:12:25.240
Do we make an arrest?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.679
When do we arrest, and where?

00:12:26.679 --> 00:12:27.840
We must decide today.

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:28.679
Let's begin the meeting.

00:12:28.759 --> 00:12:29.320
Let's discuss.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.799
Xiaohe, bring the photos in.

00:12:38.799 --> 00:12:39.440
Brother Qi.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.120
Guess whether my neighbor

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.639
will get caught this time.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.600
I think your wiretap days are numbered.

00:12:49.519 --> 00:12:52.240
That was the shortest relationship I've had.

00:12:56.919 --> 00:13:00.399
We used to select the Sci-Tech Role Model.

00:13:00.759 --> 00:13:01.879
From now on,

00:13:02.039 --> 00:13:03.039
the title has changed.

00:13:03.039 --> 00:13:04.360
It's now called Honorary Commendation.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.600
The purpose remains unchanged.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.879
It's still to motivate all employees,

00:13:08.879 --> 00:13:10.600
using exemplary models as benchmarks.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.720
Everyone, please open up

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.000
the commendation ballots on your desks.

00:13:15.279 --> 00:13:16.519
The candidates listed

00:13:16.519 --> 00:13:18.320
are not pre-recommended.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.360
What we need to discuss today

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.080
is the qualification review and evaluation.

00:13:24.159 --> 00:13:25.399
Or perhaps this Sun Yuanjin...

00:13:27.039 --> 00:13:27.720
Engineer Cao.

00:13:28.279 --> 00:13:29.679
Why even hold a vote?

00:13:29.679 --> 00:13:30.600
We'll definitely vote for you.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:31.840
We're all voting for you.

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:38.879
Who's that young kid in the back?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.039
An intern. Must be an intern.

00:13:44.279 --> 00:13:46.279
An intern, definitely an intern.

00:13:46.919 --> 00:13:48.879
Everyone, share your thoughts.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.919
If nobody else is speaking,

00:14:01.879 --> 00:14:03.240
then I'll say a few words.

00:14:03.919 --> 00:14:06.600
At my first evaluation meeting,

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.440
the former director asked me:

00:14:09.639 --> 00:14:10.600
"What kind of people

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.240
are we actually honoring?"

00:14:13.399 --> 00:14:15.759
It came down to this:

00:14:16.279 --> 00:14:17.519
"Boundless passion,

00:14:17.759 --> 00:14:18.879
relentless pursuit."

00:14:19.759 --> 00:14:21.120
By that standard,

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:22.679
I cast my vote

00:14:24.679 --> 00:14:26.720
for Comrade Jia Chunlin.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:30.720
Unbelievable.

00:14:36.679 --> 00:14:37.720
Keep academics to academics,

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:38.919
and everything else separate.

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:40.879
That is what being pragmatic means.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:42.879
That's all I have to say.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.039
Never saw that coming. Not at all.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.279
Let's applaud Engineer Cao

00:14:51.279 --> 00:14:53.279
for his selfless spirit!

00:14:53.639 --> 00:14:54.480
Give him a hand!

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.080
Old Jia, congratulations!

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.240
Well deserved!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.399
You have to treat us!

00:15:08.399 --> 00:15:09.080
Congratulations, Old Jia!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.000
Look out for us in the future!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.120
Definitely, definitely, definitely!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.320
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.000
Congratulations, Engineer Jia!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.879
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.159
Liaoping.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:29.399
Thanks for your vote.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.159
Well deserved. It's only right.

00:15:34.799 --> 00:15:36.440
Say no more between old classmates.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.600
You reported me,

00:15:42.159 --> 00:15:43.120
and I voted for you.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:45.679
You poisoned me,

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.200
and I pulled you back.

00:15:47.879 --> 00:15:49.759
We each walked away with our lives.

00:15:50.679 --> 00:15:53.279
Consider us even.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.039
Besides,

00:16:07.919 --> 00:16:10.279
about the Hong Kong, China academic tour,

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.000
I'll pass.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:15.480
You should go.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.039
Xiao Li, Xiao Li.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:27.720
Engineer Jia.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:28.720
Congratulations, congratulations!

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:30.000
I was just looking for you.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.519
I've been thinking it over,

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:35.080
and about this trip to Hong Kong, China,

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.000
spots are limited for each office.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.600
We should give it to Old Cao.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:39.679
He needs it more than I do.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:41.960
Come on, you...

00:16:42.039 --> 00:16:43.639
It'd be better for him to get out,

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:45.360
make some new friends.

00:16:45.759 --> 00:16:47.480
He needs this opportunity more than I do.

00:16:48.159 --> 00:16:50.519
The leaders inside were just praising you,

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:51.879
calling it "Burying the hatchet,"

00:16:51.879 --> 00:16:54.440
saying you're both big-hearted enough

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.200
to sail a ship in!

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.200
What do you think you're doing?

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.119
Why are you throwing things?

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:16.920
You...

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.160
You better clean this up!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:19.599
What is wrong with you?

00:17:19.599 --> 00:17:20.599
Fine, I'll clean it!

00:17:20.799 --> 00:17:21.599
What's the big deal?

00:17:21.599 --> 00:17:22.920
Are you picking a fight?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.079
What's wrong? Who upset you?

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.119
What are you yelling at me for?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.319
Do whatever you want!

00:17:28.319 --> 00:17:29.839
Look at this mess you made!

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:30.799
I'm talking to you!

00:17:30.839 --> 00:17:31.920
What are you blaming me for?

00:17:32.319 --> 00:17:33.599
Who's going to clean this mess up?

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:34.400
I will!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.319
Then clean it up!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:36.920
I'll clean it up later!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.039
Go clean it up right now!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.160
Make sure it's spotless!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.720
Do you think it's easy cleaning every day?

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:41.599
You're completely unreasonable!

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.000
You're the one being unreasonable!

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:58.519
Don't run!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:47.599
I haven't seen you before.

00:19:48.039 --> 00:19:48.680
We're replacements.

00:19:49.119 --> 00:19:49.680
Yes.

00:19:50.039 --> 00:19:51.319
What about the soldier from before?

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:52.759
He was discharged.

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:03.759
Who's that kid in the back?

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.920
An intern. Probably an intern.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.079
An intern.

00:20:10.519 --> 00:20:11.599
Safety comes first.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:15.000
Your safety must be the top priority.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:16.319
No matter when,

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.720
as long as you feel in danger,

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:18.440
even if

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.079
it's just a gut feeling,

00:20:20.559 --> 00:20:21.880
even if it's completely groundless,

00:20:22.279 --> 00:20:23.400
all you have to do is,

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.400
at 9:30 p.m. on any Sunday,

00:20:25.759 --> 00:20:28.079
hang an umbrella on your balcony.

00:20:28.359 --> 00:20:30.200
Once we see that the umbrella is open,

00:20:31.279 --> 00:20:34.000
we'll arrange your exit from the mainland.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:11.839
Something's off at the Cao house.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.359
No wind, no rain,

00:21:13.359 --> 00:21:15.160
why is there an open umbrella on the balcony?

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:17.279
It's likely a signal. He's going to run.

00:21:26.759 --> 00:21:28.440
Here is the headline news.

00:21:28.799 --> 00:21:29.960
The government of the Republic of South Africa

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.119
has officially announced

00:21:31.279 --> 00:21:32.599
that next year it will

00:21:32.599 --> 00:21:34.319
sever its so-called "diplomatic ties" with us.

00:21:34.599 --> 00:21:36.440
KMT "legislators" joined together

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.480
in protest.

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.240
"Opposition parties" also slammed

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:40.880
the authorities' botched "foreign policy."

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.519
With both sides trading blame,

00:21:42.799 --> 00:21:45.799
the executive branch recalled its envoy

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.680
to fully assess the impact on trade.

00:21:48.119 --> 00:21:48.880
Mom,

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.519
I'm back.

00:21:50.519 --> 00:21:50.960
Coming up next,

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.400
let's take a look at

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:53.960
the upcoming weather changes.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:55.400
Starting tomorrow...

00:21:58.119 --> 00:21:58.920
I'm home.

00:21:59.839 --> 00:22:01.200
Dinner will be ready soon.

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:10.920
You didn't take your cousin's calls,

00:22:11.359 --> 00:22:13.119
so she's been calling me every day.

00:22:13.559 --> 00:22:15.319
She says her husband is definitely cheating

00:22:15.319 --> 00:22:16.680
and wants us to investigate him.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.240
She might even drag Auntie over tonight

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:20.559
to talk things out in person.

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:22.880
Are you going to handle this or not?

00:22:24.119 --> 00:22:25.519
There are plenty of private investigators.

00:22:25.599 --> 00:22:27.559
Why can't she just hire one?

00:22:27.799 --> 00:22:29.160
Private investigators?

00:22:29.839 --> 00:22:31.480
You're free.

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:33.359
A detective agency costs money.

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:35.319
So who do you think she'd pick?

00:22:36.079 --> 00:22:37.039
If worst comes to worst,

00:22:37.559 --> 00:22:39.079
maybe I'll do that after I retire.

00:22:39.319 --> 00:22:41.119
It pays way better than this.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.200
Understood.

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:19.559
Your cousin...

00:23:21.559 --> 00:23:23.319
Intellectuals are always so timid.

00:23:23.839 --> 00:23:25.599
That Professor Cao from the mainland...

00:23:25.599 --> 00:23:26.839
doesn't dare stay in his nest anymore.

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:27.920
So what do we do?

00:23:29.279 --> 00:23:30.440
Are we really going to get him out?

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:39.599
Mom, dinner is ready!

00:23:50.119 --> 00:23:51.759
Why is there sand in the rice?

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:13.119
Hey, brother.

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:13.759
My good buddy!

00:24:13.759 --> 00:24:14.839
Why did you walk here?

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:15.640
Where's your car?

00:24:15.839 --> 00:24:17.920
Unregistered taxis can't enter the compound.

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:18.440
Let me tell you,

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:19.799
my driver is a real idiot.

00:24:19.799 --> 00:24:22.000
He sprained his ankle in the countryside yesterday.

00:24:23.279 --> 00:24:24.039
Come here, come over here.

00:24:25.359 --> 00:24:26.119
Starting right now,

00:24:26.119 --> 00:24:27.359
you'll be driving for Director Wu.

00:24:27.480 --> 00:24:29.400
Once his driver heals up,

00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:30.359
you can come back.

00:24:31.079 --> 00:24:32.160
That wouldn't be right, would it?

00:24:33.359 --> 00:24:34.279
If you lend me your legs,

00:24:34.279 --> 00:24:35.960
how will you take girls on dates?

00:24:36.759 --> 00:24:37.880
When you've got no one to date,

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:39.000
a driver is your legs.

00:24:39.000 --> 00:24:40.119
When you do,

00:24:40.119 --> 00:24:41.519
he's just a third wheel.

00:24:41.799 --> 00:24:43.359
Anyway, I know you're not dating anyone.

00:24:44.079 --> 00:24:45.680
Your big bro has plenty of options.

00:24:45.680 --> 00:24:46.839
You just don't know it.

00:24:47.359 --> 00:24:49.200
Let's handle our business first.

00:24:49.200 --> 00:24:49.920
Sound good?

00:24:50.839 --> 00:24:51.960
Qian Xinfu from the Price Bureau—

00:24:51.960 --> 00:24:52.920
is he coming today?

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:54.640
What's going on?

00:24:55.799 --> 00:24:57.839
Ma Qi, your brother-in-law, and I

00:24:57.839 --> 00:24:59.079
got a second-hand

00:24:59.079 --> 00:24:59.839
CT scanner for the hospital.

00:24:59.920 --> 00:25:02.359
The Price Bureau comes over constantly.

00:25:02.359 --> 00:25:03.200
One day it's a 30,000-yuan fine,

00:25:03.200 --> 00:25:04.160
the next it's 5,000.

00:25:04.160 --> 00:25:05.960
They're fining us out of business!

00:25:05.960 --> 00:25:07.559
We invited him out for drinks, but he refused.

00:25:08.000 --> 00:25:10.200
Brother, this is an investment enterprise.

00:25:10.680 --> 00:25:12.480
You got us airborne, now help us land.

00:25:13.440 --> 00:25:14.160
Isn't today's meeting

00:25:14.160 --> 00:25:15.880
supposed to solve problems?

00:25:15.920 --> 00:25:17.680
A symposium on the business environment.

00:25:17.759 --> 00:25:19.160
Besides, Mayor Xie is presiding.

00:25:19.160 --> 00:25:19.839
What are you afraid of?

00:25:19.880 --> 00:25:21.240
Just speak up directly.

00:25:21.920 --> 00:25:23.400
Brother, I haven't offended you, have I?

00:25:24.079 --> 00:25:25.279
You're telling me to commit suicide!

00:25:29.440 --> 00:25:29.960
Let's head over.

00:25:30.359 --> 00:25:30.920
All right, all right.

00:25:30.920 --> 00:25:32.240
How is this guy still alive?

00:25:32.599 --> 00:25:34.440
Since when did you two become enemies?

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:37.599
Ever since he resigned from Wo'aoma

00:25:37.599 --> 00:25:38.960
and started his own company.

00:25:39.839 --> 00:25:41.559
Let me tell you, that sly bastard

00:25:41.559 --> 00:25:42.839
definitely didn't just resign.

00:25:42.839 --> 00:25:44.880
The foreigners must've caught him embezzling.

00:25:45.880 --> 00:25:47.240
Why didn't they lock him up?

00:25:47.640 --> 00:25:49.119
Did he steal your business,

00:25:49.119 --> 00:25:50.519
or did he steal your girlfriend?

00:25:50.680 --> 00:25:52.279
He stole both!

00:25:52.680 --> 00:25:53.599
Scumbag.

00:25:54.400 --> 00:25:55.799
He has no bottom line at all.

00:25:55.799 --> 00:25:56.880
He poached my workers,

00:25:56.880 --> 00:25:59.160
and snatched the land I negotiated for.

00:25:59.279 --> 00:26:00.559
If it weren't for mainland laws,

00:26:00.559 --> 00:26:01.839
I would've shot him dead!

00:26:02.240 --> 00:26:03.319
Don't talk nonsense.

00:26:04.319 --> 00:26:05.279
Let's get drinks someday,

00:26:05.279 --> 00:26:06.319
and I'll talk to him for you.

00:26:07.240 --> 00:26:08.279
If you're truly my brother,

00:26:08.279 --> 00:26:09.880
slip some poison into his drink

00:26:09.880 --> 00:26:10.480
and poison him to death.

00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:12.240
You sure know how to joke around.

00:26:12.240 --> 00:26:13.559
Let's go to the meeting. Let's go.

00:27:10.359 --> 00:27:10.799
Engineer Cao,

00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:11.720
it's Xiao Li.

00:27:11.960 --> 00:27:13.519
The office asked me to inform everyone

00:27:13.519 --> 00:27:15.079
the Hong Kong, China conference is delayed.

00:27:15.400 --> 00:27:16.759
It's tentatively pushed back by a week.

00:27:17.920 --> 00:27:18.559
Okay.

00:27:43.160 --> 00:27:44.000
What are you shouting about?

00:27:44.720 --> 00:27:45.160
Come down here.

00:27:46.240 --> 00:27:47.240
You scared me.

00:27:47.960 --> 00:27:48.839
What brings you here, Uncle?

00:27:49.880 --> 00:27:50.960
I was just passing by.

00:27:51.160 --> 00:27:52.400
Figured it was about time you got off work.

00:27:53.079 --> 00:27:54.319
When are you heading back to the village?

00:27:54.319 --> 00:27:55.799
Hurry up with the ancestral hall matter.

00:27:56.400 --> 00:27:58.000
I'll take care of it soon.

00:27:59.519 --> 00:28:01.119
Weren't you going on an overseas inspection?

00:28:01.720 --> 00:28:02.400
Did it get approved?

00:28:02.400 --> 00:28:04.000
No, it got postponed.

00:28:04.000 --> 00:28:06.559
The provincial inspection team is coming.

00:28:06.559 --> 00:28:08.079
It's our Sports Bureau's turn this year.

00:28:08.480 --> 00:28:09.000
It's dinner time.

00:28:09.000 --> 00:28:09.559
Come up and eat.

00:28:09.559 --> 00:28:10.119
Come back.

00:28:14.079 --> 00:28:14.559
What is it?

00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:27.079
I have a very important meeting soon.

00:28:27.079 --> 00:28:28.359
I can't take this with me.

00:28:28.359 --> 00:28:29.359
I'll leave it with you for now.

00:28:29.359 --> 00:28:30.160
Keep it safe for me.

00:28:30.160 --> 00:28:31.119
Wait till I come back for it.

00:28:31.119 --> 00:28:31.759
Understood?

00:28:34.960 --> 00:28:36.559
Why can't you take it?

00:28:37.240 --> 00:28:38.440
Don't ask what you shouldn't.

00:28:38.920 --> 00:28:40.839
Keep it safe. Understood?

00:28:48.400 --> 00:28:49.960
Uncle, there's mud on your shoes.

00:28:49.960 --> 00:28:50.880
Remember to wipe them off.

00:29:01.519 --> 00:29:02.799
Where are you heading, sir?

00:29:10.960 --> 00:29:12.720
Driver, Xiamen Gaoqi Airport.

00:29:12.720 --> 00:29:13.240
80.

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:13.720
Let's go.

00:29:13.720 --> 00:29:14.240
Get in.

00:29:25.880 --> 00:29:27.960
Mr. Li, you have to drink this yourself.

00:29:27.960 --> 00:29:28.720
You owe me this.

00:29:28.720 --> 00:29:29.119
All right.

00:29:30.680 --> 00:29:31.279
Mr. Zhang!

00:29:31.839 --> 00:29:32.680
Director Wu! Director Wu!

00:29:32.680 --> 00:29:33.359
Come on, over here.

00:29:33.359 --> 00:29:34.240
Sure, sure.

00:29:34.279 --> 00:29:35.559
You must invest in that project from last time!

00:29:35.559 --> 00:29:36.599
Definitely, absolutely.

00:29:36.720 --> 00:29:38.039
I've been waiting for you.

00:29:39.799 --> 00:29:40.400
Director Wu.

00:29:41.880 --> 00:29:42.720
Long time no see.

00:29:44.079 --> 00:29:44.960
These are new friends.

00:29:45.119 --> 00:29:46.119
Two new friends here.

00:29:47.000 --> 00:29:49.160
How could I forget an old friend?

00:29:49.519 --> 00:29:50.440
Alright, enjoy your drinks.

00:29:50.440 --> 00:29:51.240
Go ahead and drink.

00:29:51.240 --> 00:29:51.720
Don't let me keep you.

00:29:53.359 --> 00:29:54.519
Why are you sitting here alone?

00:29:54.519 --> 00:29:55.480
Come on, let's have a drink together.

00:29:55.480 --> 00:29:56.160
My stomach hurts.

00:29:56.160 --> 00:29:57.519
I'll hit the restroom, then drink them down!

00:29:58.079 --> 00:29:59.519
Some people just talk tough.

00:30:00.640 --> 00:30:02.000
He's already swaying on his feet,

00:30:02.359 --> 00:30:03.440
and he's still bragging.

00:30:04.720 --> 00:30:05.680
Come on, drink up.

00:30:06.079 --> 00:30:07.160
Sorry, I'm late.

00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:08.359
You're late, you're late!

00:30:09.039 --> 00:30:09.920
Come on, bottoms up!

00:30:12.440 --> 00:30:13.519
You guys enjoy your drinks.

00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:18.920
Professor Cao left ahead of schedule.

00:30:19.640 --> 00:30:20.920
You weren't supposed to get involved,

00:30:21.079 --> 00:30:22.319
but it's gotten urgent.

00:30:22.519 --> 00:30:23.759
We need you in Zhuhai.

00:30:24.160 --> 00:30:24.599
Right away.

00:30:53.359 --> 00:30:54.000
Boss.

00:30:54.319 --> 00:30:55.440
Boss, where are you going?

00:30:55.960 --> 00:30:57.759
You're Director Wu's driver now.

00:30:57.759 --> 00:30:58.640
Don't worry about me.

00:31:01.759 --> 00:31:02.240
Boss...

00:31:02.240 --> 00:31:03.279
He doesn't need the car right now anyway.

00:31:03.279 --> 00:31:04.400
I can drop you off and come right back.

00:31:04.400 --> 00:31:05.240
I'll still make it in time.

00:31:05.240 --> 00:31:05.960
Where are you off to?

00:31:05.960 --> 00:31:07.640
Whether I'm having tea, dodging drinks,

00:31:07.960 --> 00:31:09.680
or sneaking around doing shady things,

00:31:09.799 --> 00:31:11.720
do I have to report every detail to you?

00:31:27.240 --> 00:31:28.119
In the past,

00:31:28.119 --> 00:31:29.839
I heard Taiwan, China men are generous.

00:31:30.359 --> 00:31:31.559
Later, I realized

00:31:31.559 --> 00:31:33.400
they're only generous with women.

00:31:33.720 --> 00:31:34.799
Eating and drinking,

00:31:34.799 --> 00:31:36.319
it's the same stuff every day.

00:31:36.480 --> 00:31:37.640
He's way too stingy with himself.

00:31:37.839 --> 00:31:40.119
This guy really takes business seriously.

00:31:40.319 --> 00:31:41.839
Out early and back late every day,

00:31:41.920 --> 00:31:43.599
chasing down even the tiniest orders himself.

00:31:43.920 --> 00:31:44.359
Just to get your

00:31:44.359 --> 00:31:45.440
CT scanner lease contract,

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:46.480
he drank until he nearly puked blood.

00:31:46.720 --> 00:31:48.640
Frankly, someone like that never makes money.

00:31:48.720 --> 00:31:49.920
Even I can't bear to watch.

00:31:50.160 --> 00:31:52.279
So do you think he prefers doing business,

00:31:52.279 --> 00:31:53.240
or running intelligence?

00:31:54.599 --> 00:31:55.799
Intelligence is just another business.

00:31:56.440 --> 00:31:57.640
Life is an abacus.

00:31:57.640 --> 00:31:58.720
It all depends on how you move the beads.

00:31:59.319 --> 00:32:00.359
No poetry today?

00:32:00.359 --> 00:32:01.480
Working the abacus instead?

00:32:02.599 --> 00:32:03.480
That's what Huadong said.

00:32:03.759 --> 00:32:05.839
He read most case files of the past decade.

00:32:06.119 --> 00:32:08.200
He said 90% of them do it for money.

00:32:11.799 --> 00:32:12.960
Why did you go quiet?

00:32:13.640 --> 00:32:14.559
I'm just wondering...

00:32:14.559 --> 00:32:16.359
what the rest of them are actually after.

00:32:17.240 --> 00:32:19.119
If not for money, then what?

00:32:42.640 --> 00:32:43.920
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:32:44.599 --> 00:32:48.359
welcome aboard Air China.

00:32:49.119 --> 00:32:51.119
Our entire flight crew

00:32:51.400 --> 00:32:55.480
is dedicated to a pleasant flight.

00:32:55.759 --> 00:32:57.359
You were doing just fine at home.

00:32:57.559 --> 00:32:58.920
Why head to Zhuhai all of a sudden?

00:32:59.160 --> 00:32:59.759
Something came up.

00:33:00.200 --> 00:33:02.000
Business or personal?

00:33:03.720 --> 00:33:05.240
Why head to Hong Kong, China all of a sudden?

00:33:05.440 --> 00:33:07.359
Tour guides are just cards for the manager.

00:33:07.359 --> 00:33:08.319
We fill in wherever there's a gap.

00:33:08.559 --> 00:33:10.160
Travel agencies only care about making money.

00:33:10.240 --> 00:33:11.799
A colleague fell ill with asthma.

00:33:12.079 --> 00:33:13.079
He's still lying in bed

00:33:13.079 --> 00:33:14.799
at Zhuhai People's Hospital.

00:33:15.119 --> 00:33:16.680
I was sent to Hong Kong, China last minute.

00:33:16.799 --> 00:33:17.720
And on such short notice,

00:33:17.720 --> 00:33:18.920
I had to fly to Zhuhai first,

00:33:18.920 --> 00:33:20.079
and take a ferry over.

00:33:21.240 --> 00:33:23.839
The Pearl of the Orient. Great place.

00:33:24.680 --> 00:33:25.759
Have you been there before?

00:33:26.400 --> 00:33:27.480
It's my first time.

00:33:27.880 --> 00:33:29.480
Anyway, it's a small tour group, no hassle.

00:33:29.960 --> 00:33:31.720
Take them from Zhuhai to Hong Kong, China,

00:33:31.720 --> 00:33:33.519
hand them over to my colleague, and I'm off.

00:33:33.839 --> 00:33:35.240
Then I can hang out for a couple of days.

00:33:35.799 --> 00:33:36.359
What about you?

00:33:36.880 --> 00:33:38.400
Why the rush to Zhuhai?

00:33:40.119 --> 00:33:41.920
Brother Qi lined up a business deal.

00:33:42.240 --> 00:33:43.119
A hospital over there

00:33:43.119 --> 00:33:44.079
has a decommissioned, second-hand

00:33:44.079 --> 00:33:45.039
CT scanner.

00:33:45.039 --> 00:33:45.920
We've negotiated for over two weeks,

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:47.839
and we're finally about to sign.

00:33:48.160 --> 00:33:48.920
So our schedule

00:33:48.920 --> 00:33:50.880
naturally revolves around the client.

00:33:51.039 --> 00:33:52.640
If they tell us to come today,

00:33:52.640 --> 00:33:54.039
we wouldn't dare arrive tomorrow.

00:33:54.319 --> 00:33:55.799
Then why are you going to Hong Kong, China?

00:33:57.440 --> 00:33:58.839
My girlfriend is in Hong Kong, China.

00:33:58.839 --> 00:34:00.960
I'm heading over to spend a few days with her.

00:34:01.079 --> 00:34:01.920
It's on the way.

00:34:02.519 --> 00:34:04.400
We'll meet up and head back to Minzhong.

00:34:07.079 --> 00:34:08.639
Any other details to go over?

00:34:08.639 --> 00:34:09.519
Once we arrive,

00:34:09.519 --> 00:34:11.039
we definitely have to stay separately.

00:34:11.360 --> 00:34:13.519
So whether in Zhuhai or Hong Kong, China,

00:34:13.519 --> 00:34:14.880
we need to check into different hotels

00:34:14.880 --> 00:34:16.320
and book two separate rooms.

00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:17.159
Both must have king beds.

00:34:17.559 --> 00:34:18.920
In case anyone finds out,

00:34:19.039 --> 00:34:20.119
that makes it look like a lovers' quarrel,

00:34:20.119 --> 00:34:21.760
a reasonable excuse for staying apart.

00:34:22.039 --> 00:34:22.840
Remember,

00:34:23.000 --> 00:34:24.199
you're the one who got mad,

00:34:24.400 --> 00:34:25.559
ran out on your own,

00:34:25.559 --> 00:34:26.719
and booked another room.

00:34:27.840 --> 00:34:29.199
Why couldn't it be you getting mad?

00:34:29.199 --> 00:34:30.400
I think you're far more petty.

00:34:31.519 --> 00:34:32.840
Like you said earlier,

00:34:32.840 --> 00:34:33.800
I worked so hard

00:34:33.800 --> 00:34:35.559
to steal you away from someone else.

00:34:35.559 --> 00:34:36.679
I cherish you like treasure.

00:34:36.679 --> 00:34:37.840
I'm doing everything to please you,

00:34:38.039 --> 00:34:39.480
so how would I dare get mad at you?

00:34:41.239 --> 00:34:41.840
Fair enough.

00:34:44.480 --> 00:34:45.440
Tell me,

00:34:45.960 --> 00:34:47.880
will he go to Hong Kong, China overnight?

00:34:50.920 --> 00:34:52.559
That depends on whether Taiwan, China

00:34:52.559 --> 00:34:54.679
arranged an evacuation route for Cao.

00:34:55.119 --> 00:34:56.159
You must remember:

00:34:56.360 --> 00:34:57.320
if blown,

00:34:57.320 --> 00:34:58.159
abort the mission,

00:34:58.159 --> 00:34:59.000
and evacuate immediately.

00:35:00.199 --> 00:35:01.280
If the mission fails,

00:35:01.800 --> 00:35:03.519
I heard we'll be reassigned.

00:35:03.519 --> 00:35:05.199
Sorting newspapers and doing logistics.

00:35:05.320 --> 00:35:06.119
Is that true?

00:35:06.559 --> 00:35:07.679
I haven't heard about that.

00:35:07.679 --> 00:35:09.960
Who's spreading these rumors?

00:35:14.039 --> 00:35:15.840
What do we do next once we land?

00:35:16.119 --> 00:35:17.280
Anything we should watch out for?

00:35:17.639 --> 00:35:18.800
Tail that guy.

00:35:19.639 --> 00:35:21.480
See who he makes contact with,

00:35:22.000 --> 00:35:24.119
and see if we can catch anything else.

00:35:26.559 --> 00:35:28.440
If we make an arrest in Hong Kong, China,

00:35:28.920 --> 00:35:31.559
will the British Hong Kong police cooperate?

00:35:33.719 --> 00:35:35.559
Assisting in arrests requires authorization.

00:35:35.559 --> 00:35:37.159
There's bound to be some trouble.

00:35:38.000 --> 00:35:39.800
So they won't cooperate?

00:35:39.800 --> 00:35:41.599
Hong Kong, China's handover is imminent.

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:42.960
People's minds are unsettled.

00:35:42.960 --> 00:35:44.559
Everyone has their own agenda.

00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:47.239
Feigning compliance is considered cooperating.

00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:49.559
Doesn't chaos bring opportunities too?

00:35:50.280 --> 00:35:51.199
We'll see.

00:35:52.199 --> 00:35:53.239
Cao's situation—

00:35:53.239 --> 00:35:54.920
if we can't resolve it within 24 hours,

00:35:55.159 --> 00:35:56.920
we might never be able to.

00:36:27.480 --> 00:36:28.400
Yes, I've arrived.

00:36:29.280 --> 00:36:30.079
How much longer do I have to wait?

00:36:32.559 --> 00:36:33.639
Four hours.

00:37:01.280 --> 00:37:01.960
Watch out, watch out!

00:37:02.519 --> 00:37:03.400
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:37:04.519 --> 00:37:05.519
Be careful!

00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:07.239
Especially you!

00:37:07.239 --> 00:37:08.719
You break things every single time!

00:37:09.199 --> 00:37:11.360
35, 36...

00:37:13.119 --> 00:37:14.880
41, 42...

00:37:15.320 --> 00:37:17.840
Help count as you move them,

00:37:17.840 --> 00:37:19.159
to make sure the count is right.

00:37:19.599 --> 00:37:20.280
Excuse me.

00:37:20.679 --> 00:37:21.800
Whose boat is this?

00:37:22.360 --> 00:37:23.639
Mine. What's up?

00:37:24.400 --> 00:37:25.000
Boss.

00:37:25.360 --> 00:37:26.199
Come here, come here.

00:37:27.400 --> 00:37:28.519
I want to go to Hong Kong, China.

00:37:28.679 --> 00:37:29.480
Is there any way?

00:37:29.679 --> 00:37:31.320
Go call 110.

00:37:31.440 --> 00:37:32.880
They'll sort it out for you.

00:37:34.280 --> 00:37:35.360
What are you doing?

00:38:16.159 --> 00:38:16.599
Sis.

00:38:16.760 --> 00:38:17.360
Working the night shift?

00:38:17.519 --> 00:38:18.079
Night shift.

00:38:26.920 --> 00:38:27.519
Move.

00:38:46.159 --> 00:38:47.159
Make sure you remember the exact positions.

00:38:47.960 --> 00:38:49.039
Put everything back the way it was.

00:38:50.280 --> 00:38:50.800
Understood.

00:38:51.960 --> 00:38:53.000
Handle everything gently.

00:39:04.519 --> 00:39:05.199
Xiaohe.

00:39:05.920 --> 00:39:06.400
Come here.

00:39:06.840 --> 00:39:08.400
Try to go through all of these.

00:39:08.400 --> 00:39:09.800
Remember, once you're done listening,

00:39:09.800 --> 00:39:11.800
every tape must be rewound.

00:39:11.800 --> 00:39:12.679
Listen to this one first.

00:39:44.159 --> 00:39:45.920
The MIB has already mobilized,

00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:47.639
preparing to receive Cao Liaoping.

00:39:47.639 --> 00:39:48.239
The location?

00:39:48.239 --> 00:39:49.960
Qianyue Guesthouse in Yau Ma Tei.

00:39:49.960 --> 00:39:51.599
We must get there before the professor

00:39:51.599 --> 00:39:53.159
and set up surveillance.

00:39:57.800 --> 00:39:59.639
Except for this room and that one,

00:39:59.639 --> 00:40:01.000
I'll take the rest.

00:40:02.559 --> 00:40:03.719
You want all of them?

00:40:03.719 --> 00:40:04.920
My tour group arrives tomorrow.

00:40:04.920 --> 00:40:06.480
You have to hold these rooms for me.

00:40:07.199 --> 00:40:08.519
I can hold them,

00:40:08.519 --> 00:40:10.320
but you need to pay a deposit first.

00:40:11.320 --> 00:40:13.480
Boss, give me a decent discount.

00:40:13.840 --> 00:40:15.639
It's already dirt cheap.

00:40:18.679 --> 00:40:19.920
We need to hurry.

00:40:20.639 --> 00:40:22.239
With a bulk booking, we can negotiate.

00:40:22.840 --> 00:40:24.000
I'll bring all my tour groups

00:40:24.000 --> 00:40:25.000
right here in the future.

00:40:25.599 --> 00:40:27.320
Just remember to keep it between us.

00:40:27.559 --> 00:40:28.679
Otherwise, how do I know my competitors

00:40:28.679 --> 00:40:30.119
won't come snooping and undercut me?

00:40:30.440 --> 00:40:33.000
Don't worry, my lips are sealed.

00:40:33.280 --> 00:40:35.559
Competitors love posing as guests to pry.

00:40:35.559 --> 00:40:37.519
You can't let anyone see the registry.

00:40:37.519 --> 00:40:38.920
Of course not.

00:40:39.480 --> 00:40:40.320
Good to hear.

00:40:41.119 --> 00:40:41.920
Relax.

00:40:42.480 --> 00:40:45.360
Hong Kong, China business runs on trust.

00:40:54.679 --> 00:40:55.559
Professor Cao,

00:40:56.280 --> 00:40:58.880
why didn't you stick to our plan?

00:40:59.840 --> 00:41:01.960
You've disrupted all my arrangements.

00:41:02.599 --> 00:41:04.880
You're in extreme danger right now.

00:41:05.320 --> 00:41:06.199
Remember,

00:41:06.199 --> 00:41:07.440
do not act on your own.

00:41:07.679 --> 00:41:08.199
Otherwise,

00:41:08.199 --> 00:41:09.960
I can't guarantee your safety.

00:41:10.480 --> 00:41:12.320
Wait at Qianyue Guesthouse in Yau Ma Tei.

00:41:12.599 --> 00:41:14.840
It's crowded—ideal for staying hidden.

00:41:15.119 --> 00:41:16.039
I'll see you there.

00:41:22.119 --> 00:41:24.280
Boss, come over and chat.

00:41:24.400 --> 00:41:25.320
Got some free time?

00:42:06.199 --> 00:42:07.320
Brother Quan.

00:42:08.320 --> 00:42:08.960
You're back.

00:42:09.159 --> 00:42:10.239
Yeah.

00:42:17.440 --> 00:42:18.159
Got any rooms?

00:42:19.360 --> 00:42:20.199
Here to have some fun?

00:42:26.880 --> 00:42:27.599
There are two left.

00:42:28.599 --> 00:42:29.440
One at the far end,

00:42:29.679 --> 00:42:30.480
and one by the door.

00:42:31.000 --> 00:42:32.119
Give me the one at the far end.

00:42:32.280 --> 00:42:33.440
Next door is an "apartment call girl."

00:42:34.599 --> 00:42:35.840
Do you know what an "apartment call girl" is?

00:42:35.840 --> 00:42:37.559
The one who just walked by is one.

00:42:38.920 --> 00:42:39.880
Do you mind that?

00:42:40.079 --> 00:42:41.559
Make sure you've thought it through.

00:42:41.559 --> 00:42:42.719
No refunds once you rent it.

00:42:45.719 --> 00:42:46.360
Forget it then.

00:42:53.079 --> 00:42:55.360
You're in extreme danger right now.

00:42:55.559 --> 00:42:56.440
Remember,

00:42:56.440 --> 00:42:57.679
do not act on your own.

00:42:57.880 --> 00:42:58.400
Otherwise,

00:42:58.400 --> 00:43:00.159
I can't guarantee your safety.

00:43:08.239 --> 00:43:09.239
I'm Peng Yuchang,

00:43:09.239 --> 00:43:10.840
inviting you to watch the TV drama

00:43:10.840 --> 00:43:11.679
*Confrontation*.

00:43:13.320 --> 00:43:13.800
Officer,

00:43:13.800 --> 00:43:14.800
why are you arresting me?

00:43:14.800 --> 00:43:16.199
I just came here to eat.

00:43:16.639 --> 00:43:18.199
I don't even know him!

00:43:18.199 --> 00:43:20.320
Mr. Cao, I'm your defense lawyer.

00:43:20.320 --> 00:43:22.079
The police in Hong Kong, China are now accusing you

00:43:22.079 --> 00:43:24.280
of plotting and carrying out a robbery.

00:43:24.280 --> 00:43:25.079
My last name is Kan.

00:43:25.079 --> 00:43:26.840
You may call me Attorney Kan.

00:43:26.840 --> 00:43:27.679
Just how many people

00:43:27.679 --> 00:43:29.320
are you going to send to talk to me?

00:43:29.320 --> 00:43:30.280
What do you mean?

00:43:30.280 --> 00:43:31.639
We just received word.

00:43:31.639 --> 00:43:33.159
The higher-ups want to bail Cao Liaoping out.

00:43:33.159 --> 00:43:33.920
The MIB will definitely

00:43:33.920 --> 00:43:35.320
snatch him before we do.